# Vendor icon source packs (e.g. Microsoft's Azure Architecture Icons download) — local input to
# packages/diagram-core/scripts/generate-azure-icons.mjs, never committed. See that script's doc
# comment for the usage-terms rationale.
/icons/

# jmuir-dtu.29: locally generated vendor icon libraries (e.g. vendor-icons/aws-icons.json from
# packages/diagram-core/scripts/generate-aws-icons.mjs) -- public repo, vendor artwork never
# committed. The README stays so the folder always exists for the Dockerfile's COPY.
/vendor-icons/*
!/vendor-icons/README.md

# canvas-ycu: locally-cached Azure deployment secret VALUES (Postgres admin password,
# SESSION_SECRET) generated by infra/azure/deploy.sh on first run — never committed.
/infra/azure/.secrets/
